// {"files":[{"path":"\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\danie\\OneDrive\\github-repos\\drosemann\\README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":6,"newStart":1,"newLines":6,"lines":[" Hey, I'm Daniel, a dev by passion from near Frankfurt am Main, a hosting nerd and AI tinkerer, and currently in my second year of training as an IT specialist for system integration."," I live for technology, IT infrastructure and artificial intelligence, and learning by doing is my thing because I'd rather build servers than slide decks.","-That AI tinkering includes ai-chat-webui, a privacy-focused chat UI for local Ollama models: https://github.com/drosemann/ai-chat-webui","+That AI tinkering includes ai-chat-webui, a privacy-focused chat UI for local Ollama models with no framework and pure JS, grown from a three-file start in March 2025 into a workspace with projects, tasks, memory, multiple chats and user accounts on self-hosted Supabase: https://github.com/drosemann/ai-chat-webui"," I've been active in the Minecraft and hosting community for years, and since 22 April 2018 I've been running my Minecraft server ShadowUnity."," For my own projects I use my private stack, while at work I use the stack required there."," My full stack work covers HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Java, PHP, Python and React and TUI development."]}]}]}
